/* GrapherKit: gradient flow */
"Gradient flow lines" = "梯度流线";
"Flow" = "流线";

"Climbing to two summits" = "攀向两座山顶";
"Paths that follow the gradient from different starting points end on different summits. Press play on p to roll the balls along." = "从不同起点沿梯度走的路径，会停在不同的山顶上。在参数 p 上按播放，小球就沿路径滚动。";
"Gradient descent in a narrow valley" = "窄谷里的梯度下降";
"Following −∇f downhill into the valley: the path first drops across the steep walls, then slides along the floor. Press play on p." = "沿 −∇f 往谷里走：路径先沿陡峭的谷壁下坠，再沿谷底滑行。在参数 p 上按播放。";

"Steepness as a heat map" = "用热力图表示陡缓";
"The surface itself is coloured by slope, blue where it is flat and red where it is steep, with the gradient field on the floor below." = "曲面本身按坡度上色，平缓处是蓝色、陡处是红色，下面地面上再画出梯度场。";
"A range end or position must be a finite number." = "范围的端点和位置必须是有限的数。";

"A curve that draws itself" = "自己画出来的曲线";
"The upper end of t is p·2π. Press play on p and the Lissajous figure and the cycloid are drawn as p grows." = "t 的上限是 p·2π。在 p 上按播放，李萨如图形和摆线随着 p 变大一点点被画出来。";
"A knot and a torus that build themselves" = "自己生长的结和环面";
"The ranges of t and u end at p·2π. Press play on p: the trefoil knot is traced and the torus is swept out around its axis." = "t 和 u 的范围都到 p·2π 为止。在 p 上按播放：三叶结被一笔画出，环面绕轴一圈圈扫出来。";

"A tangent sliding along a curve" = "沿曲线滑动的切线";
"The point of tangency is the parameter p. Press play on p: the tangent and the normal of the cubic slide along it and the slope changes with them." = "切点就是参数 p。在 p 上按播放：三次曲线的切线和法线沿曲线滑动，斜率跟着变化。";
"A tangent plane circling a paraboloid" = "绕抛物面转一圈的切平面";
"The point of tangency is (2 cos q, 2 sin q). Press play on q: the tangent plane and its normal travel once round the bowl." = "切点是 (2 cos q, 2 sin q)。在 q 上按播放：切平面连同法线绕碗转一圈。";

"Which summit does it reach?" = "它会爬到哪座山顶？";
"One starting point travels round a circle, (3 cos q, 3 sin q). Press play on q: the path jumps from one summit to the other where the basins meet." = "一个起点沿圆 (3 cos q, 3 sin q) 走一圈。在 q 上按播放：走到两个山谷的分界处时，路径会从一座山顶跳到另一座。";

/* GrapherKit：文字描述（```grapher 代码块）的报错 */
"'%@' cannot be a parameter name (reserved or not a plain word)." = "“%@”不能当参数名（是保留名，或不是普通的字母数字词）。";
"'%@' is not a color. Use #RRGGBB or a name like red, blue, green." = "“%@”不是颜色。请写 #RRGGBB，或 red、blue、green 这样的名字。";
"'%@' layers have no opacity; only surfaces and regions do." = "“%@”图层没有透明度；只有曲面和区域有。";
"'%@' layers have no option '%@'. Options: %@." = "“%@”图层没有选项“%@”。可用的选项：%@。";
"'%@' must be on or off." = "“%@”只能写 on 或 off。";
"A '%@' layer has no formula; it only takes options such as of=." = "“%@”图层没有公式，只能写 of= 之类的选项。";
"A '%@' layer needs 'at'." = "“%@”图层需要写 at（位置）。";
"A '%@' layer needs %ld formula(s) separated by ';', e.g. %@." = "“%@”图层需要 %ld 个公式，用分号隔开，例如 %@。";
"A '%@' layer needs of= with %ld layer name(s)." = "“%@”图层需要用 of= 写出 %ld 个图层名。";
"A %@ document cannot hold '%@' layers." = "%@ 文档里不能放“%@”图层。";
"A %@ layer has no range for '%@'." = "%@ 图层没有“%@”的范围。";
"A gradient needs a 'surface' layer z = f(x, y); '%@' is not." = "梯度需要 z = f(x, y) 的曲面图层；“%@”不是。";
"A layer name cannot contain ',' or '='." = "图层名不能含有“,”或“=”。";
"A projection needs a point, space curve or intersection; '%@' is not." = "投影的对象要是点、空间曲线或交线；“%@”不是。";
"A region needs an inequality such as x^2+y^2<=1." = "区域需要写成不等式，例如 x^2+y^2<=1。";
"A scatter layer needs points: scatter: 1, 2.1; 2, 3.9; 3, 6.2" = "散点图需要写出点，例如 scatter: 1, 2.1; 2, 3.9; 3, 6.2";
"A tangent needs an explicit, parametric or polar curve; '%@' is not." = "切线需要显函数、参数方程或极坐标曲线；“%@”不是。";
"A tangent needs one position: at=1.2." = "切线需要写一个位置，例如 at=1.2。";
"A tangent plane needs a surface or parametric surface; '%@' is not." = "切平面需要曲面或参数曲面；“%@”不是。";
"A tangent plane needs two positions: at=0.5, 1." = "切平面需要写两个位置，例如 at=0.5, 1。";
"An intersection needs surfaces; '%@' is not one." = "交线需要两个曲面；“%@”不是曲面。";
"An intersection needs two different layers." = "交线需要两个不同的图层。";
"aspect must be a ratio like 1.5 or 16:9 (between 0.3 and 4)." = "aspect 要写成 1.5 或 16:9 这样的宽高比（在 0.3 到 4 之间）。";
"Cannot read this line: '%@'. A layer looks like 'surface S: sin(x)*cos(y)'." = "看不懂这一行：“%@”。图层的写法类似 surface S: sin(x)*cos(y)。";
"center must be three numbers like center=0,0,1." = "center 要写三个数，例如 center=0,0,1。";
"center must be two numbers like center=0,0." = "center 要写两个数，例如 center=0,0。";
"density must be between 2 and 40." = "density 要在 2 到 40 之间。";
"direction must be three numbers like direction=1,0,1." = "direction 要写三个数，例如 direction=1,0,1。";
"Formula: %@ (variables: %@)" = "公式：%@（可用的变量：%@）";
"levels must be numbers separated by commas, e.g. levels=1,2,-1." = "levels 要写成用逗号隔开的数，例如 levels=1,2,-1。";
"No layer named '%@'. Layers: %@." = "没有叫“%@”的图层。现有的图层：%@。";
"numbers and parameters only" = "只能写数和参数";
"onto must be a plane (a linear surface); '%@' is not." = "onto 要是一个平面（一次的曲面）；“%@”不是。";
"onto must be xy, yz, xz or a plane layer name; no layer named '%@'." = "onto 要写 xy、yz、xz 或平面图层的名字；没有叫“%@”的图层。";
"opacity must be a number between 0.05 and 1." = "opacity 要是 0.05 到 1 之间的数。";
"Parameter '%@' is defined twice." = "参数“%@”定义了两次。";
"Parameter '%@' needs a number, got '%@'." = "参数“%@”需要一个数，写的是“%@”。";
"Range or position: %@ (only numbers and parameters)" = "范围或位置：%@（只能写数和参数）";
"scale must be between 0.1 and 5 (negative draws the descent direction)." = "scale 要在 0.1 到 5 之间（负数画下降方向）。";
"size must be between 6 and 96." = "size 要在 6 到 96 之间。";
"Text needs a position: at=x, y (or x, y, z in 3D)." = "文字需要写位置：at=x, y（立体图写 x, y, z）。";
"The curve has no tangent at %@." = "曲线在 %@ 处没有切线。";
"The range of '%@' must be [lower, upper] with lower < upper." = "“%@”的范围要写成 [下限, 上限]，且下限小于上限。";
"The range of '%@' must be lower..upper with lower < upper." = "“%@”的范围要写成 下限..上限，且下限小于上限。";
"The scatter data has no valid points. Write rows like: 1, 2.1; 2, 3.9." = "散点数据里没有有效的点。请写成 1, 2.1; 2, 3.9 这样。";
"The starting points have no valid \"x, y\" row. Write rows like: 1.5, 0.5; -2, 2." = "起点里没有有效的“x, y”。请写成 1.5, 0.5; -2, 2 这样。";
